  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3" flags="0x0">
    <title>B1 - Maximum calculated bypass flow demand</title>
    <description>Upper bound on calculated flow demand before demand filtering and conversion to flap position. Evidence: CPU E3594..E35A0 clamps calculation to cal14C4, stores E3CA. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 200kompressor_EVO_Nico_Tuned.BIN. Calibration block 1. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent.</description>
