    <description>Fallback second-flap target chosen outside the normal calculation branch. Evidence: CPU E32E2..E337C target selector, cal171C/cal171E, result E3C4. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 200kompressor_EVO_Nico_Tuned.BIN. Calibration block 1. Fault/operating-state fallback in E32E2; diagnostic/adaptation overrides have precedence. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent.</description>
