    <description>Alternative base map in FD12.2 idle state, FD76.14 set. Both maps are identical in this full calibration. Evidence: CPU BF75A..BF7D4; BC002(2776,E35A), BC0E6(2784,E51A); FD76.14 selects 3D05 or 3D29. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 200kompressor_EVO_Nico_Tuned.BIN. Calibration block 3. Nominal physical scale inferred algebraically from SIM4LE PID 0E encoder E021C and inverted final angle F58C. Final angle also includes corrections, clamps and OBD quantization; this is not a direct delivered-angle command. Exact vehicle/coding meaning of FD76.14 is not established; do not label automatic/manual.</description>
