    <title>B3 - Coolant weighting of learned knock correction</title>
    <description>Weights learned/adapted knock correction around neutral0x8000; signed multiplication by curve&lt;&lt;8 divided65536 gives raw/256. Evidence: CPU F22FA..F2322 BC04A(1D7A,E06F),BC224(3428),BCCA0((learned-8000),curve&lt;&lt;8). Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 200kompressor_EVO_Nico_Tuned.BIN. Calibration block 3.</description>
