  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x169" flags="0x0">
    <title>B4 - Bypass flow function - segment intercept</title>
    <description>Selected segment intercept; E3D0 = intercept - (slope * E3CC &gt;&gt;16). Evidence: CPU E352C..E3560: BC378 chooses segment on axis236E; BC340 reads arrays92A4/92C4 without interpolation; multiplies and subtracts. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 200kompressor_EVO_Nico_Tuned.BIN. Calibration block 4. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent. Piecewise-function coefficients; not ordinary interpolated calibration curves.</description>
